{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Uncover Lost Magic</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Work as an Archivist Wizard to defeat enemies and unlock magical abilities</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Create your own spells</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2277940/extras/firecross_build.gif?t=1745689781\" />Features a voxel based spell crafting system with emergent elemental properties and runes to further control your creations, your ingenuity is the limit. The elements are at your command</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Toss enemies with your might</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2277940/extras/goblin_toss.gif?t=1745689781\" />Feel the impact of your magic, with physics to throw and smash enemies</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Face powerful foes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dash between your enemies in this first person spell-slinger, featuring a variety of enemies that you will have to overcome in unique ways. Loot them and take their power for your own, summon them to fight for you, take their spells or craft more powerful versions of your own. Features a multitude of unique enemies with differing abilities and spells across several levels </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Bring a friend</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Conquer the world together with PVE and show off your ingenuity with your spells</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2277940?t=1745689781","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2277940/b183dbe4f945ee3c97a74176471bc292ec326090/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745689781","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2277940/f7bd1d923ce10f4a2d9e702f31e358535b06ec51/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745689781",